{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/NewAboutUs2.png?t=1751058293\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Evercore Heroes: Ascension</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A <strong>co-op-first Hero Roguelite</strong> where teamwork and mastery forge legends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DEFEND THE EVERCORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a <strong>Luum Sentinel</strong>, you are one of the last heroes standing against Fate\u2019s Blade, a sinister force seeking to corrupt Lumerea\u2019s magic. The Evercore\u2014source of balance and life\u2014has been shattered, and only by recovering its fragments can you restore order before chaos takes hold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each run is a high-stakes gauntlet of enemies, strategy, and role mastery. Whether you fight <strong>solo or with a team</strong>, every mission is a new challenge\u2014<strong>fall, rise stronger, and protect the Evercore!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/CoOpENA.png?t=1751058293\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/CoopENA.gif?t=1751058293\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>TRUE CO-OP HERO ROGUELITE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Designed for teamwork, but fully playable solo</strong>, every mission challenges your coordination, adaptability, and execution. Play your role, cover your allies, and overcome impossible odds together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DYNAMIC MISSIONS, ENDLESS REPLAYABILITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Launch from Castle Everae into <strong>procedural missions</strong> full of deadly monsters, layered objectives, and intense boss fights\u2014all wrapped into <strong>tight 30-minute adventures</strong>. Each run is different. Every decision counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/HeroEN.png?t=1751058293\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/HeroENA.gif?t=1751058293\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MASTER UNIQUE HEROES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock and refine a growing roster of <strong>class-based Heroes</strong>\u2014Tank, Damage, and Support\u2014each with distinct powers, playstyles, and bold personalities. <strong>Six Heroes</strong> will be available at Early Access launch, with <strong>over a dozen total planned</strong> by full release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/StrategizeEN.png?t=1751058293\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/BuildENA.gif?t=1751058293\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EVOLVE YOUR PLAYSTYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your role and <strong>break the meta</strong> with <strong>Shards</strong>\u2014in-run, game-changing upgrades that reshape your build and let you adapt your Hero in powerful new ways. Experiment, refine, and surprise the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/ProgressEN.png?t=1751058293\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/UpgradeENA.gif?t=1751058293\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BUILD YOUR LEGACY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Progress persists</strong>. Unlock <strong>Core Powers</strong>\u2014meta progression that strengthens your Heroes between runs to go further each time. Victory or defeat, you're always advancing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/ExploreEN.png?t=1751058293\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/TravelENA.gif?t=1751058293\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPLORE A LIVING SCIENCE-FANTASY WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Journey through the <strong>Five Realms of Lumerea</strong>, beginning with the frozen peaks and mines of <strong>Kru</strong> to the vibrant jungles of <strong>Moxy</strong>. Discover a world full of danger, beauty, and hidden stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rally your team, embrace the challenge, and become the heroes Lumerea needs!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2586780?t=1751058293","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751058293","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/68ba02f20afc7a373846980aa949d7038aa62846/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751058293","capsule_imagev