m, embrace the challenge, and become the heroes Lumerea needs!</strong></p>","developers":["Vela Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/header.jpg?t=1751058293","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Evercore Heroes is a registered trade / logo mark of Vela Games, Ltd. Evercore Heroes: Ascension Copyright 2025","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257161276,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257161276/movie480.mp4?t=1750868651","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257161276/movie_max.mp4?t=1750868651"},"name":"Early Access live | Gameplay trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257161276/6fb75d8e6565a9da0db61e4446aabe5d0e93f406/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750868651","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257161276/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1750868651","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257161276/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1750868651"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257160267,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257160267/movie480.mp4?t=1750677237","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257160267/movie_max.mp4?t=1750677237"},"name":"How to Play | Explainer video EA","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257160267/c139f6d8d9d89020d06ce8348a7053b0f369da3e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750677237","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store